WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.267
-That's right,
SantaCon is officially back

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.400
in New York City.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.901
It was canceled last year,
but this weekend,

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:06.667
thousands of people
dressed like Santa

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.300
are expected to take part
in a citywide bar crawl.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.400
So I thought
I'd welcome the tradition back

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.868
with a tiny song.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:16.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.200
Thank you.

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:21.934
♪♪

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:26.400
♪ Christmas in New York
is for you, and it's for me ♪

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.100
♪ And a couple of thousand
drunken Santas ♪

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.200
♪ Stumbling down the street ♪

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.534
♪ With pillows
stuffed under red shirts ♪

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.868
♪ The most I ever saw ♪

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.868
♪ Fake white beards
and Christmas cheer ♪

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.734
♪ And cases of White Claw ♪

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:40.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:43.000
♪♪

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.133
♪ But they don't got
no reindeer ♪

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.334
♪ No cocoa piping hot ♪

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.634
♪ Just snowstorms
of Axe body spray ♪

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:51.834
♪ And dollar jello shots ♪

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:54.000
♪ There's Santas on the subway ♪

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.534
♪ There's Santas taking naps ♪

00:00:56.534 --> 00:01:01.000
♪ One Santa is break-dancing,
one's barfing in his hat ♪

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.267
♪ Some are singing carols ♪

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.200
♪ Some say "ho, ho, ho" ♪

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.767
♪ But most of them
are running, shouting ♪

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.868
"Look out, bro! Po po!"

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.133
♪ One drunk Santa,
two drunk Santa ♪

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:14.133
♪ Three drunk Santa, four ♪

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:18.634
♪ I saw Santa kiss Green M&amp;M
at the M&amp;M store ♪

00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:20.834
♪ So get your booster,
wear a mask ♪

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:23.167
♪ Be safe this SantaCon ♪

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:25.167
♪ 'Cause beer and milk
and cookies ♪

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:26.834
♪ Don't protect from Omicron ♪

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:31.100
Thank you.

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:34.300
Thank you, Roots.

